---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StaffLines from "@/components/StaffLines.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在 · 橙月Wiki" description="你要找的页面不在我们的谱上">
  <section class="container flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center py-24 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-5xl font-display font-bold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">
      这个音不在谱上
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-muted-foreground">
      你要找的页面不存在或已被移动。没关系,回首页从头开始,或搜一下想找的词条。
    </p>
    <StaffLines class="mt-10 w-72 text-signature/60" />
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition hover:opacity-90"
      >
        回首页
      </a>
      <a
        href="/search"
        class="rounded-lg border px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition hover:border-signature/50 hover:text-signature"
      >
        搜索词条
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
